h=A.y8("Store App is a full-stack e-commerce application built using Flutter and ASP.NET Core Web API. The application provides a complete shopping experience including product browsing, cart management, authentication, order processing, and online payment integration. The backend handles business logic, database management, secure authentication using JWT, and API communication with the Flutter mobile application. The project demonstrates the ability to build and manage a complete production-ready application from frontend to backend.",A.aC(["\ud83d\ude80 Key Features",A.b(["- Browse products with categories and detailed product information.","- Add products to cart and manage shopping items.","- Complete checkout process with order creation."],i),"\ud83d\udd10 Authentication & Authorization",A.b(["- Secure user authentication using JWT.","- Role-based access control for users and administrators."],i),"\ud83d\udcb3 Payment Integration",A.b(["- Integrated online payment gateway support.","- Supports secure payment processing and transaction handling."],i),"\ud83d\udce6 Product Management",A.b(["- Admin dashboard for managing products and categories.","- Upload and manage product images."],i),"\ud83d\uded2 Order Management",A.b(["- Create and track customer orders.","- Manage order status from the backend."],i),"\ud83d\udcbb Platforms",A.b(["Mobile application using Flutter.","Backend API built with ASP.NET Core Web API."],i)],g,f),"https://github.com/MostafaBaherr/storeapp/blob/main/README.md",m,n,h,"Flutter, ASP.NET Core Web API, SQL Server","Store App","Store App \u2013 Full Stack E-Commerce Application","2026")
