q=A.y8("TactiTrak is an AI-powered football analysis system that processes match footage to deliver advanced tactical insights. It detects players, ball, referees, and goalkeepers using models like YOLO and ByteTrack, and classifies players by team. The system features Zone Control, which divides the pitch into six zones and determines team dominance in each based on player distribution. Additionally, Pass Line Detection identifies all available passing options when a player is in possession, helping analyze decision-making and team positioning. TactiTrak is available as both a desktop and mobile application, offering flexibility for analysts, coaches, and fans to use it in different environments.",A.aC(["\ud83d\ude80 Key Features",A.b(["- Detect and track all essential entities on the field, including players, referees, goalkeepers, and the ball.","- Maintain persistent identity tracking across frames, even during occlusions or quick transitions."],i),"\ud83d\udd35 Team Classification",A.b(["- Using clustering techniques such as KMeans combined with jersey color analysis.- Using clustering techniques such as KMeans combined with jersey color analysis."],i),"\ud83d\udc40 Zone Control",A.b(["Divides the pitch into six tactical zones.","Calculates which team dominates each zone based on player distribution."],i),"\u2714 Pass Line Detection",A.b(["Identifies all valid passing options when a player is in possession of the ball.Visualizes pass lines to support decision-making analysis."],i),"\ud83d\udca1 Ball Possession Tracking",A.b(["Tracks and estimates ball possession over time by each team."],i),"\ud83d\udcbb Platforms",A.b(["Desktop application.","Mobile application."],i)],g,f),"https://github.com/MostafaBaherr/TactiTrackFlutter/blob/main/README.md",m,l,q,"Flutter,python(YOLO,flask)","TactiTrack","TactiTrack \u2013 AI-Powered Football Match Analysis System","2025")
p=A.b([k,"assets/images/cinelist/1.png","assets/images/cinelist/2.png","assets/images/cinelist/3.png","assets/images/cinelist/4.png"],i)
p=A.y8("Developed Cinelist, a mobile application designed for professionals in the audiovisual industry to streamline the creation and management of equipment lists during pre production. The app delivers a fast, intuitive, and fully customizable experience, enabling directors, cinematographers, gaffers, grips, and other crew members to efficiently manage gear by department or project. Built with scalability in mind, Cinelist supports both small and large-scale productions minimizing human error, enhancing organization, and accelerating workflows.\n",A.aC(["\ud83d\ude80 Key Features",A.b(["Intuitive and user-friendly interface for fast list creation.","Fully customizable equipment lists per department or project.","Saves time and effort by eliminating tedious manual processes.","Ensures nothing is overlooked during pre-production.","Ideal for small productions or large-scale operations."],i),"\ud83c\udfaf Role-Based Benefits",A.b(["Directors: Oversee all departments and track essential gear.","Cinematographers & Photographers: Organize cameras, lenses, and lighting kits.","Gaffers: Manage and customize lighting equipment lists.","Key Grip: Detail rigging and support gear for smooth setups.","Dolly Grip: Track dollies and related accessories with ease.","Audio: Compile essential sound equipment for quality audio.","Assistant Camera: Handle filters, lenses, and accessories checklists.","DIT: Organize data management and monitoring gear for post-production.","Video Assist: List playback monitors and recording devices for crew feedback.","VFX: Structure specialized tools for seamless visual effects integration.","Set Designers: Gather props and materials efficiently for production.","Production: Track gear across departments to maintain workflow integrity."],i),"\u2728 Why Cinelist",A.b(["Boosts efficiency and accuracy in the pre-production process.","Reduces costly mistakes by ensuring complete equipment coverage.","Empowers every department with tailored tools.","Fits naturally into any AV production workflow."],i)],g,f),m,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cine_list",k,p,"Flutter (firebase,cubit),","Cinelist","\ud83c\udfac Cinelist: Smart Equipment List Manager for AV Professionals","2025")
